                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Company also agrees that in the event it decides to perform work relating to the controlled release of gas, in a manner other than established practices, it will first meet with Local #80 to provide them with the opportunity to present alternative solutions to the Company prior to the Company implementing any such planned changes.",
